      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max has gone to fetch drinks, and Kostya and Nastya look around the bar. Kostya likes the place a bit too much. Then Max comes back with glasses, and it's time for a toast. Listen to the table talk in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
